Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentle Orange. I first tried that drink at 20,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,when I'd finally got a place of my own down by the harbour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.42,0:00:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when there was still life in the harbour
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.23,0:00:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,district and New Orleans was a fashionable place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the only one, mind you. But I had my own little den,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and that meant two things to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A drinks cabinet and a chance to bring girls home. Pas mal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So I learned to make drinks that tasted sweet but hit hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The favourite was Gentle Orange:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,gin and tonic with a dash of Martini Rosso and a big slice of orange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The orange scent hides the alcohol
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.62,0:00:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Martini makes it smooth as silk.
